      },
      "source": [
        "<a href=\"https://colab.research.google.com/github/reemajedz99/IT326-Diabetes/blob/main/Reports/Phase2_dana.ipyn\" target=\"_parent\"><img src=\"https://colab.research.google.com/assets/colab-badge.svg\" alt=\"Open In Colab\"/></a>"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "**3-Variabale Transformation**"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "Qo_7zg-1oYhT"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "**Description**:\n",
        "The code applies variable transformation by deriving a new attribute, Cholesterol_Ratio, from two existing attributes: CholesterolTotal divided by CholesterolHDL. The original columns were kept unchanged."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "d0vuiUH_QltF"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "**Justification**:\n",
        "Total cholesterol and HDL each describe only part of a patient's lipid profile. Their ratio is a widely used clinical indicator of metabolic and cardiovascular risk, and it summarizes both measurements in a single meaningful value. Creating it gives the mining algorithms a more informative feature than either raw attribute alone."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "y4JAwiBYRQvG"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "**Preprocessing Result**: A new numeric attribute, Cholesterol_Ratio, was added, ranging from 1.57 to 14.41 with a mean of 4.55. The original attributes were preserved and the processed data was saved separately as Preprocessed_dataset."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "7mcbwXdYgWgZ"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "**How it improved the dataset**:\n",
        "The transformation combined two related measurements into one interpretable feature that captures the balance between total and \"good\" cholesterol, enriching the dataset for classification and clustering without losing any original information."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "XrDa8OZBg0cK"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "import pandas as pd\n",
        "raw_df=pd.read_csv(\"/diabetes_data.csv\")\n",
        "df = raw_df.copy()"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "S5Iq25oSRfjv"
      },
      "execution_count": 3,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "bins = [25, 40, 60, 91]\n",
        "labels = [\"Young\", \"Middle-Aged\", \"Senior\"]"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "Ioa0Oq39Wk4G"
      },
      "execution_count": 4,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "df[\"Cholesterol_Ratio\"] = df[\"CholesterolTotal\"] / df[\"CholesterolHDL\"]"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "7ZV0QHW2WmdU"
      },
      "execution_count": 5,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "print(\"Raw dataset snapshot:\")\n",
        "print(raw_df[[\"PatientID\", \"CholesterolTotal\", \"CholesterolHDL\", \"Diagnosis\"]].head(10))"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
